              <tr><td>Photos (optional)</td><td>Sent to AI system as visual evidence to improve diagnostic accuracy</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Google account data</td><td>Create personal account, sync diagnostic history</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Location</td><td>Determine local currency and display nearby spare parts stores</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Diagnostic history</td><td>Future reference and cross-device sync</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Community content</td><td>Shared with the technician community after admin review</td></tr>
              <tr><td>FCM Token</td><td>Internal technical support only</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        `
      },
      {
        id: 's4',
        title: '4. Third-Party Services Used',
        content: `
          <h3>a. Firebase (by Google)</h3>
          <p>The app uses Firebase services for the following:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Firebase Authentication</strong>: Managing user sign-in via Google accounts.</li>
            <li><strong>Cloud Firestore</strong>: Securely storing diagnostic history and community content in the cloud.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Firebase Privacy Policy: <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy</a></p>
          <h3>b. OpenRouter</h3>
          <p>The app uses the <strong>OpenRouter</strong> service to access AI models and generate diagnostic reports. When running a diagnostic, device data, fault description, and any user-attached photos are sent to OpenRouter servers for processing and returned as a diagnostic result.</p>
          <p>OpenRouter Privacy Policy: <a href="https://openrouter.ai/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://openrouter.ai/privacy</a></p>
          <h3>c. Google Maps</h3>
          <p>The "Spare Parts Stores" screen uses <strong>Google Maps</strong> to display an interactive map. Google may collect anonymized usage data in accordance with its own privacy policy.</p>
        `
