        content: `
          <p><strong>Important Notice:</strong></p>
          <p>All diagnostic reports displayed in the app are <strong>automatically generated by an AI system</strong> based on the information entered by the user.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>These reports are <strong>advisory and technically assistive in nature only</strong>.</li>
            <li>They <strong>do not replace</strong> on-site technical inspection by a qualified specialist when needed.</li>
            <li>The app does not bear responsibility for decisions made based solely on AI diagnostic outputs without conducting appropriate technical inspection.</li>
          </ul>
        `
      },
      {
