            <li><span class="disc-num">2</span><span><strong>Not a Substitute for Professional Inspection</strong>: The app does not, under any circumstances, replace direct technical inspection or maintenance by a qualified technician or authorized service center when required.</span></li>
            <li><span class="disc-num">3</span><span><strong>Accuracy of Results</strong>: The accuracy of the suggested diagnosis depends directly on the quality and clarity of the data and images provided by the user. Incomplete or inaccurate data may negatively affect diagnostic accuracy.</span></li>
            <li><span class="disc-num">4</span><span><strong>User Responsibility</strong>: The user bears sole and full responsibility for any decision, repair, replacement, or purchase of spare parts or equipment made based on the app's results.</span></li>
