          </ul>
          <h3>a. Suspected Components</h3>
          <p>The components or parts suggested by the app as potential causes of a fault are <strong>suspected components only</strong>, based on the symptoms entered, and do not constitute a final confirmation that those components are faulty. <strong>They must be verified on-site by a qualified technician before purchasing or replacing any part.</strong></p>
          <h3>b. Service Centers &amp; Spare Parts Stores</h3>
          <p>The app may display information about the locations of service centers and spare parts stores to facilitate access. The user acknowledges that:</p>
          <ul>
