            <li>The app does not guarantee the quality of service, pricing, or availability of spare parts at those entities.</li>
            <li>Any commercial or service dealings with those entities are conducted <strong>directly between the user and the external party</strong>, without any liability on the part of the app.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>c. Safety Warning</h3>
          <div class="warning-box">⚠️ <strong>Important Warning:</strong> If there is any suspicion of electrical hazard, gas leak, high pressure, extreme heat, or any other risk that may threaten the safety of persons or property — <strong>stop work immediately</strong>, move away from the equipment, and contact a qualified technician or specialist. Do not continue using or self-diagnosing the equipment in such situations.</div>
          <h3>d. Emergency Situations</h3>
